  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency food and nutrition support to IDPs in hard-to-reach locations in Sudan.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of CAFOD&#x2019;s strategy to scale up its humanitarian response to reach out to people in hard-to-reach locations, response through the informal ERRs/CBOs and faith structures on the ground in identified locations will be used as the fastest and easiest approach to deliver the much-needed food aid and other immediate needs as will be identified in the process for the people in hard-to-reach areas, in Sudan. Given the set-up nature of these micro-support groups amidst CAFOD&#x2019;s DD processes.</narrative>
  </description>
